<div class="scrim" id="scrim" hidden>
  <div class="sheet" role="dialog" aria-modal="true" aria-labelledby="regTitle">
    <button class="x" id="closeBtn" aria-label="Close">&times;</button>
    <span class="label">REGISTER</span>
    <h2 id="regTitle">One question first</h2>
    <p class="sub">Registration runs on VIT’s own portals, and which one you use depends on where you’re coming from.</p>
    <div class="routes">
      <a class="route" href="https://vconnect.vit.ac.in/vtopconnect/login" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
        <span class="route-k">INTERNAL</span>
        <b>I’m a VIT student</b>
